<title>FINLAND: Goldman Sachs rates Benefon underperformer.</title>
<headline>Goldman Sachs rates Benefon underperformer.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. investment bank Goldman Sachs said in a research note dated September 9 it was initiating coverage of Finnish mobile phone maker Benefon Oy, rating it as market underperformer.</p>
<p>It said Benefon had missed the boat in Global System of Mobile Communication (GSM) handsets and said its outlook for 1996 was dismal.</p>
</text>
